---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import NavBar from '../components/NavBar.astro';
---

<Layout title="Color Lumie — Privacy Policy">
  <NavBar />
  <h1 class="mb-2 font-serif text-4xl font-bold">Color Lumie — Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="mb-6 text-sm text-gray-600">
    Last updated:
    {' '}
    {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US')}
  </p>

  <div class="space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed">
    <section class="space-y-2">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">1. Introduction</h2>
      <p>
        This Privacy Policy describes how we collect, use, and protect your
        information when you use our app. By using the app, you agree to the
        practices described here.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-2">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">2. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        We collect information you provide when you sign up (such as email and
        display name when you use email sign-in, or name from Apple/Google),
        your lumie (a short note), your lumie color (a color code), and your list of friends and related activity. We
        also collect device and usage data necessary to run the app and improve
        our services.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-2">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>
        We use your information to provide and improve the app, to personalize
        your experience, to communicate with you, and to enforce our Terms of
        Service. We do not sell your personal information to third parties.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-2">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">4. Sharing and Disclosure</h2>
      <p>
        We may share information with service providers that help us operate the
        app (such as hosting and authentication). We may disclose information if
        required by law or to protect our rights and safety. Your friends list
        and profile are visible only as designed within the app (for example, to
        people you have added as friends).
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-2">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">5. Data Security</h2>
      <p>
        We use industry-standard measures to protect your data. Your account is
        protected by your sign-in credentials. You can delete your account at
        any time from the Profile screen, which will remove your data from our
        systems.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-2">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">6. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>
        Depending on where you live, you may have the right to access, correct,
        or delete your personal information. You can update your profile in the
        app and delete your account from the Profile screen. Contact us if you
        have other requests.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-2">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">7. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you
        of material changes via the app or email. Continued use of the app after
        changes means you accept the updated policy.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-2">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">8. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or your data, please
        contact us through the app or at the support email provided in the app
        listing.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
